{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"『16人のプリンシパルdeux』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6日目は初めて沢村に挑戦！\n女中4として二幕に\n出ることができました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も沢村に立候補したけど、\n今回は二幕にも出ることが\nできませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"投票してくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しいぜ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近考える。\n私はなぜアイドルになったんだろう。\n高3になると進路の話が\n当たり前だけどまとわりつく。\n私は今の私がいいんだ！\n本気なんだー！中途半端は嫌いだ！\nつまり乃木坂だいすき！\n乃木充！乃木充！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/09/1151847/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/09/1151847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/09/1151847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/09/1151847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/09/1151847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}